msgstr "¿Iniciar grabado?"

#: ui_dialogs.py:7701
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure? Card will engrave centered on machine (X={x:.0f}, "
"Y={y:.0f}), covering ({ox:.0f}, {oy:.0f}) to ({fx:.0f}, {fy:.0f}).\n"
"\n"
"Takes a while. The cover must stay closed for the laser to fire.\n"
"\n"
"If you haven't framed yet to verify placement, click No and run Frame "
"first."
msgstr ""
"¿Seguro? La tarjeta se grabará centrada en máquina (X={x:.0f}, "
"Y={y:.0f}), cubriendo de ({ox:.0f}, {oy:.0f}) a ({fx:.0f}, {fy:.0f}).\n"
"\n"
"Tarda un rato. La tapa debe permanecer cerrada para que el láser dispare."
"\n"
"\n"
"Si aún no has encuadrado para verificar la posición, pulsa No y ejecuta "
"Encuadrar primero."

#: ui_dialogs.py:7747
msgid "Engraving Calibration Card"
msgstr "Grabando tarjeta de calibración"

#: ui_dialogs.py:7762
msgid "Engrave stopped. Put fresh basswood, re-Frame, then Engrave."
msgstr "Grabado detenido. Pon tilo nuevo, vuelve a Encuadrar y luego Grabar."

#: ui_dialogs.py:7798
msgid "Engrave complete. Click Next when ready for calibration captures."
msgstr ""
"Grabado completo. Pulsa Siguiente cuando estés listo para las capturas de"
" calibración."

#: ui_dialogs.py:7803
msgid "Card Engraved — DO NOT TOUCH"
msgstr "Tarjeta grabada — NO LA TOQUES"

#: ui_dialogs.py:7804
msgid ""
"Card engraved successfully.\n"
"\n"
"⚠ DO NOT MOVE THE CARD. ⚠\n"
"\n"
"Click Next to start calibration captures. The first capture becomes the "
"position reference linking the camera to machine coords — if the card "
"moves before then, the calibration is off."
msgstr ""
"Tarjeta grabada correctamente.\n"
